{"seq":1,"slug":"cuda-grid-block-thread-mapping","title":"CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-grid-block-thread-mapping","wordCount":2087,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"cuda-thread-block-grid-映射与-kernel-骨架设计\">CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计</h1><p>写一个 CUDA kernel，前 20 行的成败几乎全由两件事决定：<strong>问题形状被映射成了什么样的 thread/block/grid 结构</strong>，以及<strong>搭了什么样的 kernel 骨架</strong>。同一个卷积或归约算法，<code>&lt;&lt;&lt;N, 1024&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> 与 <code>&lt;&lt;&lt;M, 256&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> 的差距可以是 3 倍吞吐——不是算法变了，是映射变了。本文谈这两个骨架层问题：如何从 built-in 变量算出全局索引，如何选 block 与 grid 尺寸，如何在 Hopper / Blackwell 上引入 cluster 这一新维度，最后给一个可复用的骨架模板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CUDA 的执行层级是四层的：<strong>thread → warp → block → grid</strong>。<code>thread</code> 是逻辑执行单元；硬件把连续的 32 个 thread 打包成一个 <strong>warp</strong>（warp size 在 Volta 至今所有架构上恒为 32），warp 才是 SM 真正的调度、发射与访存单位；<code>block</code>（CTA）是能共享 shared memory 与做 <code>__syncthreads()</code> 同步的单元；<code>grid</code> 是一次 kernel launch 的全部 block。价值在于：<strong>索引按 thread 粒度写，性能按 warp 粒度结算</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    G[Grid&lt;br/&gt;一次 kernel launch] --&gt; B0[Block 0&lt;br/&gt;共享 shared memory]&#10;    G --&gt; B1[Block 1]&#10;    G --&gt; BN[Block N-1]&#10;    B0 --&gt; W0[Warp 0&lt;br/&gt;thread 0-31]&#10;    B0 --&gt; W1[Warp 1&lt;br/&gt;thread 32-63]&#10;    B0 --&gt; WK[Warp k]&#10;    W0 --&gt; T0[thread 0]&#10;    W0 --&gt; T1[thread 1]&#10;    B1 --&gt; S1[SM 上并发驻留]&#10;    BN --&gt; S1\">graph TD\n    G[Grid&lt;br/&gt;一次 kernel launch] --&gt; B0[Block 0&lt;br/&gt;共享 shared memory]\n    G --&gt; B1[Block 1]\n    G --&gt; BN[Block N-1]\n    B0 --&gt; W0[Warp 0&lt;br/&gt;thread 0-31]\n    B0 --&gt; W1[Warp 1&lt;br/&gt;thread 32-63]\n    B0 --&gt; WK[Warp k]\n    W0 --&gt; T0[thread 0]\n    W0 --&gt; T1[thread 1]\n    B1 --&gt; S1[SM 上并发驻留]\n    BN --&gt; S1</pre><p>kernel 内部通过四个只读 built-in 变量感知自己在这层级中的位置，它们的存在形式是三维向量：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>取值范围（CC ≥ 3.0）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>threadIdx</code></td>\n<td><code>uint3</code></td>\n<td>当前 thread 在 block 内的坐标</td>\n<td><code>x,y ∈ [0,1024)</code>，<code>z ∈ [0,64)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>blockIdx</code></td>\n<td><code>uint3</code></td>\n<td>当前 block 在 grid 内的坐标</td>\n<td><code>x ∈ [0, 2³¹-1]</code>，<code>y,z ∈ [0,65535]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>blockDim</code></td>\n<td><code>dim3</code></td>\n<td>每个 block 的 thread 数（launch 时确定）</td>\n<td>block 总 thread 数 ≤ 1024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gridDim</code></td>\n<td><code>dim3</code></td>\n<td>grid 的 block 数（launch 时确定）</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四个变量合起来给出<strong>唯一全局索引</strong>。一维情形下这条公式是所有 CUDA 代码的地基（NVIDIA 官方 grid-stride 文章，<a href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/cuda-pro-tip-write-flexible-kernels-grid-stride-loops/\">https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/cuda-pro-tip-write-flexible-kernels-grid-stride-loops/</a> ）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>blockIdx.x</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>blockDim.x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>threadIdx.x</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = \\text{blockIdx.x} \\times \\text{blockDim.x} + \\text{threadIdx.x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blockIdx.x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blockDim.x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threadIdx.x</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>blockIdx.x * blockDim.x</code> 是本 block 之前的所有 thread 数，加 <code>threadIdx.x</code> 落到本 block 内的偏移。二维、三维只是给每个轴各算一次、再用宽高做步长加权（见下节）。</p>\n<p>一个约束必须刻进肌肉记忆：<strong>block 总 thread 数不得超过 1024</strong>，且 blockDim 每个分量有独立上限（x、y 各 1024，z 只有 64）。所以&quot;最大的合法 block&quot;是 <code>dim3(1024,1,1)</code> 或 <code>dim3(32,32,1)</code>，而非 <code>dim3(1024,1024,1)</code>。越界 launch 直接返回 <code>cudaErrorInvalidConfiguration</code>，kernel 不执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引公式与边界检查\">索引公式与边界检查</h2><p>多维映射的关键是<strong>行主序（row-major）展平</strong>。对于一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 的矩阵，一个二维 block 给出：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"int col = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;&#10;int row = blockIdx.y * blockDim.y + threadIdx.y;&#10;if (row &lt; H &amp;&amp; col &lt; W) {&#10;    int flat = row * W + col;&#10;    out[flat] = in[flat] * 2.0f;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockIdx.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threadIdx.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockIdx.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threadIdx.y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> H </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> row </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> W </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> col;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out[flat] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in[flat] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个工程要点藏在细节里：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>边界检查（guard）不是可选项。</strong> 只有保证 <code>H % blockDim.y == 0</code> 且 <code>W % blockDim.x == 0</code> 时，去掉 <code>if</code> 才安全。动态尺寸数据（一批 SKU 数、一条清关记录的商品行数）几乎不整除，必须保留 guard；否则越界写会污染相邻张量，表现为&quot;结果偶尔错一点&quot;这种最难查的 bug。</li>\n<li><strong><code>x</code> 轴映射到访存最快的维度。</strong> GPU 的合并访存沿 warp 内 <code>threadIdx.x</code> 连续方向进行。把 <code>col</code> 放在 <code>threadIdx.x</code>，同一 warp 的 32 个 thread 访问连续地址，一次 128 字节事务即可；放反了则一个 warp 跨行访问、需 32 次事务，带宽掉一个数量级。</li>\n<li><strong>每个轴的上限要独立检查。</strong> grid 的 <code>y</code>、<code>z</code> 轴上限定死 65535。当 <code>H/blockDim.y &gt; 65535</code>（约 4.2 亿行以上）时必须改用一维展平，否则 <code>dim3</code> 溢出静默截断。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>维度选择上：一维映射（索引最低、单个判断）适合向量加法、归约、一维卷积；二维 block + 二维 grid 适合矩阵乘、图像、二维 stencil，但 x/y 放反会毁掉合并访存；三维适合体数据与 <code>batch×head×seq</code> 注意力，代价是三个判断且 <code>gridDim.z ≤ 65535</code> 易溢出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"block-尺寸选择与占用率\">Block 尺寸选择与占用率</h2><p>Block 尺寸不是一个自由参数，它被三条硬约束夹住：<strong>warp 对齐、资源占用、occupancy 上限</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>第一条，必须是 32 的整数倍。</strong> 非 32 倍数的 block 会让最后一个 warp 只用部分线程（100 thread = 3 满 warp + 1 个 4-thread warp），浪费发射槽。取值集中在 128、256、512：256 最常用，兼顾 occupancy 与寄存器压力。</p>\n<p><strong>第二条，寄存器和 shared memory 才是 occupancy 的真瓶颈。</strong> 一个 SM 能驻留多少 block，取决于三者取最小值：thread 数上限、block 数上限、寄存器/shared memory 容量。近两代架构对照（源：NVIDIA CUDA Programming Guide Compute Capabilities，<a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/index.html\">https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/index.html</a> ；架构表 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CUDA\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CUDA</a> ）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>架构（compute capability）</th>\n<th>每 SM 最大 thread 数</th>\n<th>每 SM 最大 block 数</th>\n<th>每 block 最大 shared memory</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Ada Lovelace (8.9)</td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td>24</td>\n<td>99 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hopper (9.0)</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>227 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blackwell 数据中心 (10.x)</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>227 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blackwell 客户端/边缘 (12.x)</td>\n<td>1536</td>\n<td>32</td>\n<td>99 KiB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>occupancy 的定义是&quot;每 SM 活跃 warp 数 / <code>maxThreadsPerSM/32</code>&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>第三条，occupancy 不是越高越好。</strong> kernel 是访存或计算瓶颈（而非延迟瓶颈）时，把寄存器让给每个 thread、降低 occupancy 反而更快。做法是先用运行时 API 查询候选配置的实际驻留 block 数，再实测：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"int numBlocks;&#10;cudaOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor(&amp;numBlocks, myKernel, blockSize, 0);&#10;int gridSize = numBlocks * smCount;  // smCount 来自 cudaDeviceGetAttribute\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numBlocks;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cudaOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">numBlocks, myKernel, blockSize, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gridSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numBlocks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> smCount;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // smCount 来自 cudaDeviceGetAttribute</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Hopper 上每 SM 最大 2048 thread、32 block 这两条同时生效，意味着 block=1024 时每 SM 最多 2 个 block，block=256 时最多 8 个 block——后者对延迟隐藏通常更友好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"grid-尺寸策略与-grid-stride-loop\">Grid 尺寸策略与 grid-stride loop</h2><p>Grid 尺寸有两种哲学：<strong>&quot;一个 thread 一个元素&quot;</strong>（<code>gridSize = ceil(N / blockSize)</code>）与 <strong>grid-stride loop</strong>。前者直观但有上限——<code>gridDim.x</code> 最大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，超大数组会踩线；后者用固定大小的 grid 反复跨越数据，摆脱问题尺寸：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"__global__ void saxpy(int n, float a, const float* x, float* y) {&#10;    for (int i = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;&#10;         i &lt; n;&#10;         i += blockDim.x * gridDim.x) {   // stride = 整个 grid 的 thread 总数&#10;        y[i] = a * x[i] + y[i];&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">__global__ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> saxpy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockIdx.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threadIdx.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gridDim.x) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // stride = 整个 grid 的 thread 总数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        y[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> y[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>步长 <code>blockDim.x * gridDim.x</code> 就是网格里全部 thread 的数量。一个 1280 thread 的 grid 里，thread 0 依次处理索引 0、1280、2560…… 收益四点：<strong>问题规模与 grid 规模解耦</strong>（小 grid 也能处理超出设备最大 grid 的数组）、<strong>便于调优</strong>（grid 取 SM 数整数倍即负载均衡）、<strong>摊薄线程创建/销毁开销</strong>、<strong>保持合并访存</strong>（相邻 thread 每轮仍访问相邻元素，步长 1）。</p>\n<p>实践里的&quot;两全&quot;配方：<code>gridSize = min(ceil(N/blockSize), 32 * numSMs)</code>——既避免超大 grid 又打满 GPU。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hopper-blackwell-cluster-作为新一维\">Hopper / Blackwell：cluster 作为新一维</h2><p>从 Hopper (sm_90) 起，block 与 grid 之间多插了一层：<strong>thread block cluster</strong>——一组<strong>被硬件保证同时调度</strong>到同一 GPC 内多个 SM 上的 block（NVIDIA Hopper 架构详解，<a href=\"https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-hopper-architecture-in-depth/\">https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-hopper-architecture-in-depth/</a> ）。H100 上单 cluster 最大 16 个 block（可移植上限 8）；编程上用 Cooperative Groups 的 <code>cluster.sync()</code> 做跨 block 屏障，核心收益是 <strong>distributed shared memory (DSM)</strong>——线程可直接读写另一 SM 上 block 的 shared memory，NVIDIA 实测比绕 global memory 快约 7 倍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    GR[Grid] --&gt; CL[Cluster&lt;br/&gt; guaranteed co-scheduled]&#10;    CL --&gt; C0[Block 0&lt;br/&gt;SM 0]&#10;    CL --&gt; C1[Block 1&lt;br/&gt;SM 1]&#10;    CL --&gt; C15[Block 15&lt;br/&gt;SM 15]&#10;    C0 --&gt; D0[DSM 直接访问他块 shared memory&lt;br/&gt;cluster.sync 硬件屏障]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D0&#10;    C15 --&gt; D0\">graph TD\n    GR[Grid] --&gt; CL[Cluster&lt;br/&gt; guaranteed co-scheduled]\n    CL --&gt; C0[Block 0&lt;br/&gt;SM 0]\n    CL --&gt; C1[Block 1&lt;br/&gt;SM 1]\n    CL --&gt; C15[Block 15&lt;br/&gt;SM 15]\n    C0 --&gt; D0[DSM 直接访问他块 shared memory&lt;br/&gt;cluster.sync 硬件屏障]\n    C1 --&gt; D0\n    C15 --&gt; D0</pre><p>对 kernel 骨架的直接约束：<strong>cluster 尺寸必须在编译期或 launch 时显式声明</strong>（<code>__cluster_dims__(x,y,z)</code> 或 launch 配置属性），且 gridDim 必须能被 cluster 尺寸整除。Blackwell 引入 cluster launch control 与 work stealing，允许 cluster 运行时从 grid &quot;偷取&quot;更多 block 做负载均衡，映射演化为<strong>半动态调度</strong>，但底层 thread/block 索引语义不变。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>引入架构</th>\n<th>同步原语</th>\n<th>与 grid 的约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>thread / warp</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td><code>__syncwarp()</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>block</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td><code>__syncthreads()</code></td>\n<td>整除于 grid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cluster</td>\n<td>Hopper (9.0)</td>\n<td><code>cluster.sync()</code></td>\n<td>gridDim 必须整除 cluster 尺寸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>grid</td>\n<td>全部（协作式）</td>\n<td>Cooperative Groups grid sync</td>\n<td>需协作式 launch</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kernel-骨架设计模板\">Kernel 骨架设计模板</h2><p>把前面的规则收进一个可复用的骨架，体现&quot;<strong>结构正确优先于性能魔法</strong>&quot;：边界检查、SM 数感知的 grid、错误处理一次到位，性能调优再在骨架上迭代。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"__global__ void elementwise_kernel(const float* __restrict__ in,&#10;                                   float* __restrict__ out, int n) {&#10;    int i = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x;&#10;    int stride = blockDim.x * gridDim.x;&#10;    for (; i &lt; n; i += stride) {          // grid-stride：尺寸无关&#10;        out[i] = __ldg(in + i) * 2.0f;    // __ldg：只读缓存路径&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void launch(const float* d_in, float* d_out, int n) {&#10;    int device, smCount, blockSize = 256;&#10;    cudaGetDevice(&amp;device);&#10;    cudaDeviceGetAttribute(&amp;smCount, cudaDevAttrMultiProcessorCount, device);&#10;    int gridSize = std::min((n + blockSize - 1) / blockSize, 32 * smCount);&#10;    elementwise_kernel&lt;&lt;&lt;gridSize, blockSize&gt;&gt;&gt;(d_in, d_out, n);&#10;    cudaError_t err = cudaGetLastError();       // launch 本身同步错误&#10;    if (err != cudaSuccess) { /* 记录并失败 */ }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">__global__ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> elementwise_kernel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> __restrict__ in,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   float*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> __restrict__ out, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockIdx.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> threadIdx.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockDim.x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gridDim.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // grid-stride：尺寸无关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        out[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> __ldg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(in </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // __ldg：只读缓存路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> launch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> float*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> d_in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> d_out</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> device, smCount, blockSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    cudaGetDevice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">device);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    cudaDeviceGetAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">smCount, cudaDevAttrMultiProcessorCount, device);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gridSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blockSize, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> smCount);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    elementwise_kernel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gridSize, blockSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>>></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d_in, d_out, n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cudaError_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cudaGetLastError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // launch 本身同步错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cudaSuccess) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /* 记录并失败 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>骨架每处都对应上文一条结论：<code>blockSize = 256</code> warp 对齐且 occupancy 友好；<code>32 * smCount</code> 让 grid 对齐硬件；<code>__restrict__</code> 与 <code>__ldg</code> 让编译器走只读缓存路径、消除别名假依赖；<code>cudaGetLastError()</code> 第一时间暴露 launch 配置错误。跨境电商场景里，这类 elementwise / reduction 骨架是推荐打分、特征归一化、批量 embedding 后处理的主力形态，映射选择直接决定整条推理链路延迟。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>执行层级是 <strong>thread → warp(32) → block → grid</strong>；索引按 thread 写、性能按 warp 结算，<code>threadIdx.x</code> 必须映射到访存最快的轴。</li>\n<li>索引地基是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>blockIdx.x</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>blockDim.x</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>threadIdx.x</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = \\text{blockIdx.x} \\times \\text{blockDim.x} + \\text{threadIdx.x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blockIdx.x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blockDim.x</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threadIdx.x</span></span></span></span></span></span>；多维用行主序展平，每轴独立做边界检查。</li>\n<li>硬约束：block 总 thread ≤ 1024（x/y 各 ≤1024、z ≤64）；<code>gridDim</code> 的 y/z ≤ 65535、x ≤ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>Block 尺寸取 128/256/512（32 的倍数）；occupancy 真瓶颈是寄存器与 shared memory，用 <code>cudaOccupancyMaxActiveBlocksPerMultiprocessor</code> 实测而非猜。</li>\n<li>优先 grid-stride loop：用 <code>blockDim.x * gridDim.x</code> 作步长，grid 与问题尺寸解耦，保持合并访存。</li>\n<li>Hopper/Blackwell 的 cluster 在 block 与 grid 间加了一层，DSM 让跨 block 共享内存访问比 global memory 快约 7 倍，但 gridDim 必须整除 cluster 尺寸。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本文属于本章「CUDA Kernel 编程与并行优化」，章节内后续主题（共享内存与 bank conflict、warp 级原语、异步拷贝）均建立在本文的映射与骨架之上。章节目录见 <a href=\"./\">本章 INDEX</a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CUDA thread/block/grid 映射与 kernel 骨架设计","id":"cuda-thread-block-grid-映射与-kernel-骨架设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"索引公式与边界检查","id":"索引公式与边界检查"},{"level":2,"text":"Block 尺寸选择与占用率","id":"block-尺寸选择与占用率"},{"level":2,"text":"Grid 尺寸策略与 grid-stride loop","id":"grid-尺寸策略与-grid-stride-loop"},{"level":2,"text":"Hopper / Blackwell：cluster 作为新一维","id":"hopper-blackwell-cluster-作为新一维"},{"level":2,"text":"Kernel 骨架设计模板","id":"kernel-骨架设计模板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Shared Memory bank conflict 与占用率延迟隐藏调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/simt-execution-memory-hierarchy/shared-memory-bank-conflict-occupancy"},"next":{"title":"CUDA 并行模式：tiling、reduction、scan 与矩阵乘实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/gpu-kernel-programming-cuda-trriton-simt/cuda-kernel-programming-optimization/cuda-tiling-reduction-scan-patterns"}}